== S1: Euler-Lagrange of S_m (minimal coupling) ==
  scalar EL khronon-free: True
  (sign check: with + sign residual zero? False )
  nabla_m T^m_n = +(EL/sqrtg) d_n chi identically (EL as sympy euler_equations lhs): True [0, 0]
  dust (baryon Euler) EL khronon-free: True
  photon geodesic (Liouville operator of the Boltzmann hierarchy) EL khronon-free: True
== S2: linear Newtonian gauge, nabla_m T^mn = 0 per fluid + Thomson drag ==
  g: delta' = 4*Derivative(Phi(eta, X), eta) - 4*Derivative(v_g(eta, X), X)/3
  g: v'     = -Derivative(Psi(eta, X), X) - Derivative(delta_g(eta, X), X)/4
  b: delta' = 3*Derivative(Phi(eta, X), eta) - Derivative(v_b(eta, X), X)
  b: v'     = -Hc(eta)*v_b(eta, X) - Derivative(Psi(eta, X), X)
  free symbols: ['R', 'X', 'eta', 'taudot_T']  functions: ['Hc', 'Phi', 'Psi', 'delta_g', 'v_b', 'v_g']
  linear photon-baryon system khronon-free: True
  plane wave: dg' = -4*th(eta)/3 + 4*Derivative(ph(eta), eta) | theta_g' (no drag) = k**2*(dg(eta)/4 + ps(eta)) | theta_b' (no drag) = k**2*ps(eta) - Hc(eta)*th(eta)
  tight-coupling dg'' coefficient of dg / (-k^2) = c_s^2 = 1/(3*(R + 1)) -> True
== S3: anisotropic stress of the khronon/P sector, local orthonormal (Newtonian-gauge) frame ==
  v3s: per sector: {'Q': {'tilt0': '0', 'tilt1_zero_offshell': True}, 'W': {'tilt0': 'Emag*Pmag', 'tilt1_zero_offshell': True}, 'P': {'tilt0': '-2*Amag*Pmag', 'tilt1_zero_offshell': False}, 'gamma': {'tilt0': '-2*Pmag*cpar*gamma', 'tilt1_zero_offshell': False}}
     traceless spatial stress = s (khat khat - delta/3), s(off-shell, no tilt) = Pmag*(-2*Amag + Emag - 2*cpar*gamma)
     on shell: s = -Pmag*(Amag*f1*gamma + Amag + Df1*gamma) | s == -|P||E|: True | tilt-linear piece zero on shell: True (off shell xy comp: Pmag*nu2*(-Ldot + cDn*gamma - lambda) )
  AC2q: per sector: {'Q': {'tilt0': '0', 'tilt1_zero_offshell': True}, 'W': {'tilt0': 'Emag*Pmag', 'tilt1_zero_offshell': True}, 'P': {'tilt0': '-2*Amag*Pmag', 'tilt1_zero_offshell': False}, 'gamma': {'tilt0': '-2*Pmag*cpar*gamma', 'tilt1_zero_offshell': False}}
     traceless spatial stress = s (khat khat - delta/3), s(off-shell, no tilt) = Pmag*(-2*Amag + Emag - 2*cpar*gamma)
     on shell: s = -Pmag*(Amag*f1*gamma + Amag + Df1*gamma) | s == -|P||E|: True | tilt-linear piece zero on shell: True (off shell xy comp: Pmag*nu2*(-Ldot + cDn*gamma - lambda) )
  on the law: s = -(a0/K) |E| x/(1+x) = -a0**2*x**2/(K*(x + 1))  -> linear in |E| once x >~ 1 (not zero)
  slip/Psi upper bound (z 1100), canonical x=1: {'0.01': 5.837739878843329e-06, '0.03': 1.945913292947776e-06, '0.1': 5.837739878843327e-07, '0.3': 1.945913292947776e-07}  x=100: {'0.01': 0.0005837739878843328, '0.03': 0.0001945913292947776, '0.1': 5.837739878843327e-05, '0.3': 1.945913292947776e-05}
  alt x=1: {'0.01': 7.054956946836718e-06, '0.03': 2.351652315612239e-06, '0.1': 7.054956946836716e-07, '0.3': 2.351652315612239e-07}  x=100: {'0.01': 0.0007054956946836718, '0.03': 0.0002351652315612239, '0.1': 7.054956946836716e-05, '0.3': 2.351652315612239e-05}
== S4: S_m has no tau dependence ==
  dL_m/dtau, dL_m/d(d tau) all zero: True
== S5: MUTATE-gravity: L_int = beta n_m u^m on the baryon worldline ==
  khronon in mutated baryon Euler equation: True | beta=0 reduces to geodesic: True
  control: beta d tau/d lambda (total derivative) drops out: True
